      "@id": "entity:source-pages_homeschool_homeschoolrequirementspage.when_you_upload_a_pdf_or_csv_ollama_extr",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "When you upload a PDF or CSV, Ollama extracts the criteria once and caches them. Re-uploading the same file skips Ollama entirely (checksum match). A different file triggers re-extraction. Pre-seeded state sets were hand-authored and are always instant. Sets expire annually — you'll see a warning near the expiry date."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_homeschool_homeschoolrequirementspage.when_you_upload_a_pdf_or_csv_ollama_extr-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Quando carichi un PDF o un CSV, Ollama estrae i criteri una sola volta e li archivia. Ricalcando lo stesso file salta completamente Ollama (con confronto controllo di controllo). Un file diverso provoca la ri-estrazione. I set pre-seed stati sono stati manualmente autorevolti e sono sempre istantanei. I set escono annualmente — vedrai un avviso vicino alla data di scadenza.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_homeschool_homeschoolrequirementspage.when_you_upload_a_pdf_or_csv_ollama_extr-2026-05-31T21:50:10.421079+00:00"
